      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("But the road to Elensefar was a treacherous one. Konrad and his men were set upon by a strong band of undead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Muff Malal",
            text: _("Ahh, a party of elves approaches. Soon we shall have elven zombies serving us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Advisor",
            text: _("My lord! On yonder peninsula there seems to be some movement!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("It looks like an undead outpost! If we could defeat them, the locals would probably be grateful. But I do not know if we have the strength to defeat such a foe, or the time to spare."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Advisor",
            text: _("Cleansing this land of undead does not appear overly difficult. It could be good training for those yet untested in battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I see. If we are to break the siege of Elensefar, we will need every veteran soldier we can get."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Advisor",
            text: _("The decision is yours, sir. If we are to leave, I advise we hurry past before they are upon us. If we are to fight, then... to arms!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
